elecom providers, and enterprise fiber networks in Bangladesh, this 1×4 PLC Splitter is perfect for branching networks to four subscribers or for multi-point distribution in fiber optic networks.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features:</h3><p><br></p><ul><li>Split Ratio: 1×4 for equal optical power distribution</li><li>Wavelength Range: 1260–1650 nm (EPON, GPON, CATV compatible)</li><li>Low Insertion Loss: ≤ 7.0 dB typical</li><li>High Uniformity: ≤ 1.0 dB</li><li>Durable Packaging: Mini Module, ABS Box, LGX Box</li><li>Connector Options: SC/UPC, SC/APC, LC/UPC, LC/APC, bare fiber</li><li>Certified Reliability: Telcordia GR-1209 &amp; GR-1221</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"ZTI 1×2 PLC Fiber Optic Splitter","href":"/zti-1%C3%972-plc-fiber-optic-splitter","now":"140৳","old":"150৳","single":""},{"name":"ZTI 1×16 PLC Fiber Optic Splitter","href":"/zti-1%C3%9716-plc-fiber-optic-splitter","now":"","old":"","single":"450৳"},{"name":"ZTI 1×8 PLC Fiber Optic Splitter","href":"/zti-1%C3%978-plc-fiber-optic-splitter","now":"","old":"","single":"210৳"}]},{"title":"Video","active":false,"cls":"tab-5","noExpand":true,"kind":"empty"},{"title":"Review","active":false,"cls":"tab-6","noExpand":false,"kind":"review"}],"side":{"title":"From Same Brand","items":[{"href":"/zti-1%C3%9716-plc-fiber-optic-splitter","image":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/1%C3%9716%20PLC/ZTI%201%C3%978%20PLC%20Fiber%20Optic%20Splitter%20P1-100x100.jpg.webp","alt":"ZTI 1×16 PLC Fiber Optic Splitter","width":100,"height":100},"name":"ZTI 1×16 PLC Fiber Optic Splitter","now":"","old":"","single":"450৳","tax":"Ex Tax:450৳","out":false},{"href":"/zti-1%C3%972-plc-fiber-optic-splitter","image":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/China/ZTI-1%C3%972-PLC-Fiber-Optic-Splitter-P1-100x100.jpg.webp","alt":"ZTI 1×2 PLC Fiber Optic Splitter","width":100,"height":100},"name":"ZTI 1×2 PLC Fiber Optic